<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Corporate Express appoints MD/CEO.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Corporate Express appoints MD/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Office products group Corporate Express Australia Ltd said on Monday it had appointed Joe Foster as managing director and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Foster was formerly the managing director of Huntsman Chemical Co Australia Pty Ltd, a joint venture between Huntsman Chemical Corp of the United States and Kerry Packer's unlisted Consolidated Press Holdings.</p>
<p>Corporate Express said Foster would join the company on March 1 and also join the board of directors. The company had sales of A$140.76 million in the first half of the 1996/97 year ending June 30.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
